### ASYM_Q 1449 5, H1 1454 99, H2 1553 99, LOGDA_C 1652 18, STPI 1670 130, SPA_C 1800 10,
### SPA_S 1810 12, ASA_C1 1822 16, ASA_C2 1838 24, ASA_C3 1862 56. DB holds (x, f, df) triples
